The default values for `JdbcMutableAclService` are:

```java
private String classIdentityQuery = "call identity()";
private String sidIdentityQuery = "call identity()";
```

These defaults are intended for HSQLDB. For PostgreSQL, configure them as:

```java
classIdentityQuery = "select currval(pg_get_serial_sequence('acl_class', 'id'))";
sidIdentityQuery = "select currval(pg_get_serial_sequence('acl_sid', 'id'))";
```
